## Dataset sources:

### london_weather_data_2020_to_2023.csv
Klein Tank, A.M.G. and Coauthors, 2002. Daily dataset of 20th-century surface air temperature and precipitation series for the European Climate Assessment. International Journal of Climatology, 22, 1441-1453.
Data and metadata are available at http://www.ecad.eu.

### gapminder.tsv
https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/albertovidalrod/gapminder-dataset

### diabetes.csv
https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/hasibur013/diabetes-dataset

### titanic.csv
https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/yasserh/titanic-dataset

### bike.csv
https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/archit9406/bike-sharing?resource=download

### gfmt_sleep.csv
https://rs.figshare.com/articles/dataset/Performance_and_sleep_measure_data_for_Experiment_from_Perceptual_impairment_in_face_identification_with_poor_sleep/4056660?file=6569010

### movies.csv
https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/bharatnatrayn/movies-dataset-for-feature-extracion-prediction
